[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20900400_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20900400_01_0010","text":"『我把自己喜欢的东西藏起来了』\n『因为被人说是女孩子的东西，就放弃了』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20900400_01_0020","text":"『果穗酱好厉害』\n『怎样才能像果穗酱一样一直保持喜欢呢？』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20900400_01_0030","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20900400_01_0040","text":"果穗……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20900400_01_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20900400_01_0050","text":"制作人"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20900400_01_0060","text":"嗯"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20900400_01_0070","text":"我……\n我知道这些……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20900400_01_0080","text":"『都六年级了还？』\n『明明是个女孩子？』……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20900400_01_0090","text":"『长大了还要继续喜欢吗？』……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20900400_01_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20900400_01_0100","text":"就是……那种话……！"}]
